 "applies_to": "Mitsubishi Heavy Industries VRF systems (up to 128 indoor units, or 80 with up to 12 monitored outdoor units on the large license) through the Intesis 700 Series Air gateway IN776MHI***O000.",
 "summary": "The IN776MHI***O000 is a multi-protocol Intesis 700 Series gateway for Mitsubishi Heavy Industries VRF systems that serves them as BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP objects (one map for both). It has global (all units) objects, an outdoor-unit block with compressor, temperature and pressure readings, and a 25-object-wide block per indoor unit; instances follow fixed formulas.",
